{% comment %} Instant-style “Your plan in 3 steps” for Orange coaching. {% endcomment %}
<section class="lx-steps" id="lx-steps" aria-labelledby="lx-steps-title">
  <div class="lx-steps__inner">
    <p class="lx-steps__eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="lx-steps__title" id="lx-steps-title">Your plan in 3 steps</h2>
    <ol class="lx-steps__list">
      <li>
        <span>01</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Pay once</strong>
          <p>Checkout with Razorpay. UPI, cards, or netbanking. You get an email with every next step.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>02</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Create your account</strong>
          <p>We email the next steps. Finish the short assessment and photos in the app.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>03</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Receive your plan</strong>
          <p>Personal workout + diet in 24–48 hours. If it does not arrive, you get a refund. Issues after that go through Coach chat, weekly check-ins, or reply to the email.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .lx-steps {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 0% 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.16), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 40% at 100% 100%, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12), transparent 50%),
      #070707;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 12px 16px 40px;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .lx-steps__inner { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .lx-steps__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #ff6200;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .lx-steps__title {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .lx-steps__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .lx-steps__list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: start;
    background: #141414;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
  }
  .lx-steps__list li:nth-child(1) {
    border-color: rgba(255, 98, 0, 0.45);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(255, 98, 0, 0.16), #141414 55%);
  }
  .lx-steps__list li:nth-child(2) {
    border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.45);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.16), #141414 55%);
  }
  .lx-steps__list li:nth-child(3) {
    border-color: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.45);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.16), #141414 55%);
  }
  .lx-steps__list span {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .lx-steps__list li:nth-child(1) span { color: #ff6200; }
  .lx-steps__list li:nth-child(2) span { color: #60a5fa; }
  .lx-steps__list li:nth-child(3) span { color: #4ade80; }
  .lx-steps__list strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .lx-steps__list p {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .lx-steps__list { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }
</style>
